<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PresMed buys 25 pct Aukland hospital unit.</title>
<headline>PresMed buys 25 pct Aukland hospital unit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Medical Investments Ltd said on Wednesday it had reached agreement to acquire 25 percent of HospiPlan, the wholly-owned private hospital subsidiary of Aukland Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>Depending on the level of profitability of HospiPlan, PresMed will pay between 9.6 million and 11.8 million rand in cash for the stake. The deal is effective from July 1.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
